      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like to see this reworked as well. perhaps have options like what udon scripts get with Continuous, Manual, and None. not saying there's a use case for none, but manual would definitly help for items at rest, you will never have EVERY pickup picked up AT THE SAME TIME, so there's no need for a constant ping for them.",
